  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_NEAR" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for Neighbourhood and Enlargement Negotiations</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Preparatory studies under EU GREEN FACILITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To support the EU Delegation and the Government of Egypt :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;i)To identify, develop and perform training and capacity building programmes in the water sector that shall be implemented through the EU GREEN FACILITY expected to be co-signed in 2024, and associated communication plan. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(ii)To prepare a set of conceptual analysis and technical studies for the following areas: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1-The drainage systems to be applied in newly reclaimed lands with modem irrigation methods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2- Actions that can be taken to increase the lifespan of subsurface drainage (SSD) networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3- Optimal standards and controls; technically as well as environmentally and economically; that can be applied in the rehabilitation of existing SSD networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;4- Industrial Wastewater Reuse. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This analysis will identify areas needing reform and enhancement, providing a clear roadmap for changes to be implemented under the EU GREEN FACILITY.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
